
  Inline formatting

  Paragraphs can mix bold, italic, code spans, and
  highlighted text inside a single flowing line that wraps
  at the container's content width.

  A second paragraph keeps the same pattern: strong + em +
  code + mark all participating in the inline formatting
  context, each carrying its own cascaded style per
  fragment.



── background ──



...................................aaaaaaaaaa
..bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb



..aaaa...bbbb





a Rgb(31, 33, 35)
b Rgb(255, 255, 0)
